        "explanation": "Family confirms understanding of plan, including meds, red flags, and follow-up",
        "quote": "新冠那个阴性不是说肾炎好了，还是要到门诊查尿、肾功能，还有您说的补体、抗体那些"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00087",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that COVID negative does not mean lupus nephritis is stable",
