        "event_id": "lite_evt_00148",
        "explanation": "Doctor gives clear emergency criteria and confirms the plan is safe",
        "quote": "只要没有尿明显变少、尿色很不对、发烧、喘不上气、水肿按下去有坑或血压明显升高这些情况"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00193",
        "explanation": "Doctor obtains family teach-back that meds not self-adjusted",
        "quote": "药按袋子吃、不自己停不减"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ends with a safe, executable plan: family confirms the follow-up appointment, medication adherence, red-flag monitoring, and contingency actions. All blocking residual risks are addressed, and the family demonstrates understanding through teach-back.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
