        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00148",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly bounds what can and cannot be resolved in this episode",
          "quote": "只要明早您按她眼皮和小腿迎面骨没有明显凹坑"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00193",
          "explanation": "Doctor closes by carrying forward allowed residual risks",
          "quote": "您把每一步都落实得很清楚，孩子有您这样细心的妈妈真的很幸运"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 (safe bounded closure) is fully achieved. The doctor clearly demarcates the limits of this episode—what can be resolved (interpretation of results, next steps) and what cannot (online assessment of remission, direct medication changes)—and ensures the family carries forward the plan with residual risks appropriately managed. The closure is safe, executable, and traceable.",
